        <item>
            <title>Version 1.7.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 15:07:16 -0500</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Repair for stuck Homebrew upgrades</h2>
<p>If a Homebrew cask upgrade was ever interrupted, Homebrew leaves the old version in a leftover <code>.upgrading</code> folder, and every later update fails with "It seems there is already an App at…".</p>
<ul>
<li>UpdateScout now recognises this and explains it in plain English.</li>
<li>The failed card shows a <b>Repair</b> button. It moves the leftover folder to the <b>Trash</b> (recoverable, never deleted) and reinstalls the app cleanly.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
